ViewAssist_Companion_App_Overlay

Derived from View Assist Companion App integration by msp1974 and contributors.
https://github.com/msp1974/ViewAssist_Companion_App
Upstream revision: 530849d96d375ae2054735a6b9c48bf8a420485d (0.13.3).

This Overlay fork replaces the satellite-owned transport and voice/tablet
platforms with a separate Overlay identity, entry-owned TCP connection,
dashboard/media entities, alarm popup routing, update checks and optional
Fire TV ADB permission setup. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.
